              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Tedi"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used the basic recipe but tweaked it to fit my style of baking. I used half the butter, no salt, one banana instead of extract, 1 cup of whole wheat flour and half cup of white flour. And I used about 3/4 of a cup of each of the sugars. II didn't say what kind of oats so I used old fashioned. I also sprayed the pan. The cookies came off much easier! They are yummy!",
            "datePublished": "2013-09-01T19:44:00.393Z"
          },
